<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρμ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>called after</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermes,
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. λόφος,</span> in Ithaca, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.471
			</span></i> (expl. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρμαξ</span>
			 by Sch. ad loc.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. λέπας Λήμνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					283
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1459
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermes,
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λύρη,</span> the constellation <i>Lyra,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				674
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμαῖος, ὁ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), month at Argos, etc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				8.33
			</span></i>; in Boeotia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.289
			</span></i>, al.; in the Aetolian league, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1745
			</span></i>, al.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμαιών.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>gainful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιμόνων δόσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					947
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμαΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, κρήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
